### 模块控制 — catalog / 启停
### 写操作：若配置了 http_auth，需 Bearer 或 X-DB-Token

### 合并列表（含 enabled）
# @name modulesList
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules

### catalog 原始镜像
# @name modulesCatalog
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules/catalog

### 单个模块（:key = manifest id 或 catalog 别名）
# @name moduleGet
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules/{{moduleKey}}

### PATCH 切换 enabled
# @name modulePatch
PATCH {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules/{{moduleKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{httpAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true
}

### PUT 切换 enabled
# @name modulePut
PUT {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules/{{moduleKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{httpAuth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}

### 启用模块
# @name moduleEnable
POST {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules/{{moduleKey}}/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{httpAuth}}

### 禁用模块（core 会返回 module_cannot_disable）
# @name moduleDisable
POST {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/modules/{{moduleKey}}/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{httpAuth}}
